WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
It doesn't matter

2
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:02,240
First given to the soldiers guarding the city

3
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:04,000
At night they defended the city with extra troops.

4
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:06,440
Wearing an extra layer of clothing can protect them from the cold

5
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:07,920
If others are dissatisfied

6
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:08,960
You can report it to me

7
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:10,720
We can also listen to what others say

8
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,300
Let's see what they think. Then I understand.

9
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,660
General, it's getting late. You should go to bed early.

10
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:20,100
Is there any arrangement for the family I brought back today?

11
00:00:20,340 --> 00:00:21,300
And according to what he said

12
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:22,660
It seems there are people over there at Dushan Pass

13
00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:24,620
I'm going to take someone there for a tour tomorrow.

14
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:26,460
I just took the opportunity to let them get familiar with the iron horse.

15
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:29,780
The situation in the city is not optimistic now

16
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:31,900
There will definitely be more and more people here

17
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:34,180
I'm going to solve more and more people's living problems

18
00:00:34,380 --> 00:00:35,740
You can't do this to bring coins down

19
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:38,980
I have to go around a lot more. I can’t sleep anymore.

20
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:40,140
Let’s go find Dushan

21
00:00:41,790 --> 00:00:43,350
Brother Xiao, what are you doing?

22
00:00:43,470 --> 00:00:44,430
I can't sleep in the middle of the night

23
00:00:44,510 --> 00:00:45,870
But I don’t want to disturb your sleep

24
00:00:46,070 --> 00:00:47,070
So just stay outside

25
00:00:47,070 --> 00:00:48,310
Just lie there all night
